          "id": 1302083492,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The difference now is that you get the warning pop-up immediate when switching to a profile with an issue, instead of getting the warning when looking at the coloring rules.\n\nIn general I don't like pop-up messages when switching profile, but in this case it's probably best to warn as early as possible so the user knows about it and can fix it.\n\nLGTM.",
